{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.119, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:43.405Z", "t_ms": 8070, "delta": " bottom-up fashion, but they use fundamentally different representations and clustering methods to group information before summarizing.\n\n### GraphRAG\n* **Knowledge"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.334, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:43.618Z", "t_ms": 8282, "delta": " Graph Extraction:** An LLM extracts a knowledge graph from the source text, where nodes represent key entities and edges represent relationships and"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.56, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:43.845Z", "t_ms": 8510, "delta": " associated claims [C2, C8].\n* **Hierarchical Community Partitioning:** GraphRAG applies graph-based"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.717, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:44.005Z", "t_ms": 8670, "delta": " community detection algorithms (e.g., Louvain or Leiden) to exploit graph modularity and partition the graph into a hierarchy"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.897, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:44.183Z", "t_ms": 8848, "delta": " of nested communities of closely related entities [C1, C3].\n* **Leaf-Level Summarization:** For"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.12, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:44.406Z", "t_ms": 9071, "delta": " leaf-level communities, element summaries (descriptions of nodes, edges, and claims) are prioritized in decreasing order of node"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.406, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:44.647Z", "t_ms": 9311, "delta": " prominence (combined source and target node degree) and fed into a community summary template within the LLM context window [C8].\n* **"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.598, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:44.882Z", "t_ms": 9546, "delta": "Higher-Level Summarization:** For higher-level communities, if all element summaries fit within the context window, they are summarized"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.851, "data": {"request_id": "5a3f51bb94ca", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:15:45.138Z", "t_ms": 9803, "delta": " directly [C8]. If they exceed the limit, sub-communities are ranked by token length, and sub-community summaries are recursively substituted"}}
